==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*4 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A surprisingly tricky stage: constant waves of Dagshunds give way for THE SLOTH to advance at a persistent rate. Stall with an [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] while upgrading your wallet as soon as the stage starts, then send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] alongside meatshields once the first Dagshund makes its appearance. You want to nuke it out of existence with One Horn caught in the crossfire to fill up your wallet. Once they're both dead, start swarming the enemies with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] and Island Cats. It will take a while to exhaust the Dagshunds, but cleanup should be easy once the dust settles.

